    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "selection.rs has one test module named tests. Add the new test function at the end of that module, before its closing brace. Do not write a second mod tests. Add is_forward on impl Selection. The body is one comparison: self.head >= self.anchor. Do not nest an if inside an if. Do not touch is_caret, range, covers, min, or max. The test a_backward_selection_is_not_forward builds Selection::caret of Offset(4) and checks is_forward is true. A selection with anchor Offset(5) and head Offset(1) is not forward. A selection with anchor Offset(1) and head Offset(5) is forward. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep the change under about 60 lines."
